Package: deli
Title: M-Estimation and Empirical Sandwich Variance Estimation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Malcolm", "Barrett", , "malcolmbarrett@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0299-5825"))
Description: Provides a general API for M-estimation via solving
    estimating equations with empirical sandwich variance estimation.
    Includes pre-built estimating equations for basic statistics,
    regression, causal inference, survival analysis, measurement error,
    and pharmacokinetics. An R port of the Python 'Delicatessen' library.
